#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:592
msgid "You pay the AI provider directly at their standard rate. OpenAI GPT-4o costs roughly $0.001 per image, about $1 for 1,000 images. There are no markups or hidden fees from us."
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:595
msgid "Is my API key stored securely?"
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:596
msgid "Yes. Your API key is stored in the WordPress database using standard wp_options, the same way WordPress stores all sensitive settings. It is never logged or exposed in the frontend."
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:599
msgid "Which AI provider gives the best results?"
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:600
msgid "OpenAI GPT-4o and Google Gemini 2.0 Flash both deliver excellent SEO-friendly alt text. We recommend starting with Gemini, which has a generous free tier so you can test before spending anything."
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:603
msgid "Can I use Pro on multiple sites?"
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:604
msgid "Yes. The Starter plan covers 1 site, Studio covers 5 sites, and Agency covers 15 sites. All plans include the full feature set; only the number of site activations differs."
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:607
msgid "Can the AI use my page content to write better alt text?"
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:608
msgid "Yes. The Send Image Context to AI option passes the image filename and the attached post or page title into the AI request, so the alt text can name the real venue, product, or location instead of only describing what is visible. A context strength setting (Strict, Balanced, or SEO) controls how strongly those keywords are used, and it is off by default."
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:611
msgid "Can I add my brand to every image's alt text automatically?"
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:612
msgid "Yes. The Alt Text Prefix / Postfix feature wraps a fixed brand name or product category before and after your alt text across your whole library, with no manual editing. You can apply it to copied titles, copied filenames, AI output, and auto-add on upload independently, and leaving the fields empty changes nothing."
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:615
msgid "What is your refund policy?"
msgstr ""

#: views/admin/iat-get-pro-view.php:616
msgid "We offer a 30-day money-back guarantee, no questions asked. If Pro does not work for your site for any reason, contact us within 30 days of purchase for a full refund."
msgstr ""

